Upload the generated headshot to Canva.

Compare it with the original photograph.

Use available photo editing and background tools to refine the result.

If a face-swap app such as Reface is available and appropriate, use it only when needed and with permission.

Review facial resemblance, skin tone, lighting and image quality.

Export the final headshot in a suitable image format.

Important: Preserve an authentic representation of the person. Avoid face swapping that changes identity or creates a misleading professional image.

